# Product Review

Khi tao Review phai kiem tra:

1. User so huu Order (order.user_id == currentUserId).
2. Order da COMPLETED theo nghiep vu.
3. order_item_id thuoc Order cua user.
4. Product cua Review khop Product trong OrderItem.
5. Mot OrderItem khong bi review nhieu lan (UNIQUE constraint tren order_item_id).

## product_id

- product_id co the duoc giu nhu **intentional denormalization / read optimization** de truy van review theo product nhanh.

## Image (album review)

- Review album anh dung bang images (owner_type=REVIEW) - khong con product_reviews.image_urls JSONB (da xoa V4).
- Khi user upload anh cho review -> upload qua ImageService voi ownerType=REVIEW, ownerId=reviewId.
- 1 review co the co nhieu anh, toi da 1 primary.

## Visibility

- Review co status VISIBLE / HIDDEN.
- Chi Review VISIBLE moi dem vao rating avg/count tren Product.
- Admin co the HIDDEN review vi pham noi quy.

## Endpoint

- POST /api/v1/products/{productId}/reviews - Authenticated (placeholder).
- GET /api/v1/products/{productId}/reviews - Public, paging, filter by rating/hasMedia, ratingDistribution + mediaCount.
- GET /api/v1/users/me/reviews - Buyer xem review cua minh (placeholder).
- DELETE /api/v1/reviews/{id} - Owner hoac Admin (placeholder).

> review/controller/ProductReviewPublicController.java da implement GET public endpoint (Subplan 3). Review album anh dung bang images (owner_type=REVIEW) - khong con product_reviews.image_urls JSONB (da xoa V4).

